Template logos on the Seylo website

The files in this folder are the logos of the Seylo template catalog (Seylo-dev/Templates, commit
da90a4f313ceeb5a9532e0255a9773863b61551f), at the same paths as in that repository: templates/<slug>/logo.<ext>.
The catalog's NOTICE, which credits each of them, follows.

